<%# locals: id, messages -- a field's *warnings* slot (tiptap Task 5): things
    that didn't stop the save but didn't land exactly as typed either (a
    Markdown conversion that dropped an unknown directive, say). Same
    always-render, replace-to-clear contract as `_field_errors` -- an empty
    `messages` is what clears the previous save's warnings -- just styled
    as a warning rather than an error. %>
<div id="<%= id %>" class="mt-1 text-sm text-warn-ink">
  <% messages.each do |message| %>
    <p><%= message %></p>
  <% end %>
</div>
